  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">㈱みずほフィナンシャルグループ</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E31159-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">(保有目的)長期安定的な金融取引に関わる関係維持のため</jpcrp030000-asr_E31159-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:QuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">(定量的な保有効果)　（注）１</jpcrp_cor:QuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">無（注）２ </jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
