  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSecuritiesFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(有価証券関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;"&gt;前事業年度(&lt;span&gt;2023年２月28日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;子会社株式は、市場価格のない株式等のため、子会社株式の時価を記載しておりません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;なお、市場価格のない株式等の子会社株式の貸借対照表計上額は次のとおりであります。　&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0.3pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:312pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:156pt;min-width:156pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:156pt;min-width:156pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:34.5pt;min-height:34.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;区分&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;前事業年度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;(百万円)&lt;/p&gt;
